# =========================
# demo
# =========================
# Screenshots are megabytes each and git keeps them forever.
demo/*.png
demo/vendor/
# ...but the recovered road shapes have to ship. They are 169 KB, deterministic, and
# demo/build_geometry.py CANNOT regenerate them from a fresh clone: it reads
# Map/simplified_* and Map/Map_fined/, neither of which is in the repository. Without
# this file the demo draws every merged edge as a straight chord -- including 十甲東路,
# 4.3 km of road as one line across the city -- with no local way to fix it.
!demo/arena_geometry.json

# =========================
# SUMO export
# =========================
# Everything under integration/sumo/ is regenerated by `python export_sumo.py` followed
# by `sh build_net.sh`: the network from the tracked arena CSVs, the routes from a
# checkpoint that is not tracked, and the live_*.log files from a running demo.
integration/sumo/

