# =========================
# Minimum inputs a clone needs to reproduce anything (432 KB total)
# =========================
# Everything above ignores *.csv / *.npy / *.pkl / *.json wholesale. These few files
# are the difference between "a repository you can read" and "a repository you can
# run": without them `run_compare.py` cannot build a graph at all.
# Road-graph CSVs are an OpenStreetMap derived database -- ODbL, see NOTICE.md.
!Map/arena_nodes_taichung.csv
!Map/arena_edges_taichung.csv
!Map/arena_meta.json
!integration/taichung_pred_edges.csv
!integration/taichung_pred_edges.meta.json
!integration/data/adj_mx_dijsk.pkl
!integration/stgcn_pred.npy
!integration/stgat_pred.npy
